    {
      "name": "content",
      "type": "content",
      "default": "<h2>Interested in applying<br> to El-Rapha?</h2>\n<p>You can complete the online application form below or send your application (resume and cover letter) directly by email to: <strong><a href=\"mailto:recrutement@el-raphaga.com\">recrutement@el-raphaga.com</a></strong></p>\n<p>However, we recommend considering geographical proximity when choosing a location. Candidates are encouraged to submit their application electronically with an uploaded resume.</p>"
